  "label": "wheelchair as symbol of disability",
  "description": "The wheelchair is a powerful symbol in the context of disability, often representing both physical limitation and societal exclusion. The meme uses this symbol to make a statement about identity and equality, requiring background knowledge of how disability symbols are culturally interpreted and the social meanings attached to assistive devices.",
